<article class="ltx_document ltx_fleqn">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">SynDoc: A Hybrid Discriminative-Generative Framework for Enhancing Synthetic Domain-Adaptive Document Key Information Extraction</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
