<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>Detailed Prompts</h2>

<div id="A3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We list all the prompts used in this paper for synthetic data generation in Table  <a href="#A3.T9" title="Table 9 ‣ Appendix C Detailed Prompts ‣ SynDoc: A Hybrid Discriminative-Generative Framework for Enhancing Synthetic Domain-Adaptive Document Key Information Extraction" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a> and MLLM zero-shot testing in Table <a href="#A3.T10" title="Table 10 ‣ Appendix C Detailed Prompts ‣ SynDoc: A Hybrid Discriminative-Generative Framework for Enhancing Synthetic Domain-Adaptive Document Key Information Extraction" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a>.</p>
</div>
