<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 11: </span>Per-epoch GPU consumption and time cost across different datasets with a fixed batch size of 16. The reported times correspond to the most effective training configurations: 2 epochs for structural adaptation and 10 epochs for semantic adaptation.</figcaption>
