<section id="A5.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">E.2 </span>More Detailed Experimental Results</h3>

<div id="A5.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We provide the detailed experimental results of different configurations for the MLLM inferencing, from Table <a href="#A5.T13" title="Table 13 ‣ E.2 More Detailed Experimental Results ‣ Appendix E Additional Evaluation Results ‣ SynDoc: A Hybrid Discriminative-Generative Framework for Enhancing Synthetic Domain-Adaptive Document Key Information Extraction" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">13</span></a> to Table <a href="#A5.T25" title="Table 25 ‣ E.2 More Detailed Experimental Results ‣ Appendix E Additional Evaluation Results ‣ SynDoc: A Hybrid Discriminative-Generative Framework for Enhancing Synthetic Domain-Adaptive Document Key Information Extraction" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">25</span></a>.</p>
</div>
