<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:50%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 9: </span>Qualitative case studies about Ephoie dataset for demonstrating the effectiveness of Top-<math id="A5.F9.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="K" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>K</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K</annotation></semantics></math>.</figcaption>
